<title>USA: U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said the 17.392 million bushels of wheat, 39.566 million of corn and no bushels of barley inspected for export in the week ended Nov 7 were for the following shipment from port areas or inland inspection points (1,000 bu).</p>
<p>	     Wheat     Corn	Barley</p>
<p> Lakes     3,304	NIL	  NIL</p>
<p> Atlantic    NIL	NIL	  NIL</p>
<p> Gulf	8,629   28,068	  NIL</p>
<p> Pacific   5,328   10,690	  NIL</p>
<p> Interior    131	808	  NIL</p>
</text>
